  Lines:
  - Splendid job! The door is now open and you may continue to the next level.
  - This was the first room serving as a basis for the next rooms.
  - 'I will not assist in the next rooms so make sure you remember to:'
  - Use the terminals to control elements in the room, look for clues and ports.
    Have fun!
